1:0":{"text":"아아아악! 이 <style=\"highlight\">벌레</style>들은 대체 뭐야?! 가려워 죽겠네!","source_cn":"啊啊啊啊！哪来的<style=highlight>小虫...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1C5B9968BE1BE7D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1123628002:0":{"text":"얼른, 얼른 좀 잡아줘!","source_cn":"快、快！帮我把它们抓出来！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCABA79E1B6C292C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:战士萨恩":{"text":"전사 샤른","source":"战士萨恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep1/quest_story/11236290.json":{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11236290","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11236290","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1123629001:1":{"text":"샤른, 괜찮아?","source_cn":"萨恩！你没事吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA12210D62A18B4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1123629002:1":{"text":"이젠 괜찮아! 망할 벌레들이 털 속으로 기어들어 가서 안 나오지 뭐야!","source_cn":"已经没事了！都怪那群讨厌的小虫子，爬进毛里就不肯出来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67AA9C58B4894177","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1123629003:1":{"text":"다행이군. 조금 쉬었다가 시련을 끝내도록 하자.","source_cn":"那就好。我们休息一阵，再继续完成试炼吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C607AE7618F10D3","v